			"• プラグスーツは艶のある質感で表現。"
		],
		"en": [
			"30 MINUTES LABEL From \"30 MINUTES PREFERENCE\", Shikinami Asuka Langley who appears in \"Evangelion Rebuild\" is commercialized in a plug suit!",
			"• Comes with two types of face parts with tampo printing.",
			"• Comes with unprinted face parts and water transfer decals to recreate facial expressions.",
			"• Comes with the Spear of Cassius.",
			"• Comes with replacement parts for sitting.",
			"• The plug suit has a glossy texture."
		]
